Can I afford all the expenses that are going to come with moving in, like a removalist fan, like buying boxes, like buying boxes, like buying, little knick-knacks that you need for a house, like a fruit bowl. I didn't know that I needed that. And I've never needed that. It's always been accessible to me in my previous homes. Toilet paper. At toilet paper stand, there's so many little expenses. Fight off any of those cognitive distortions that are trying to get you and convince you to spend more money and be realistic about what this is actually going to cost before you just become enamored with the idea. I think that is all that we have time for today.

